<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-836] CI: flaky build of frontend webapp</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-836</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;We have CI failing on webapp build with no particular reason.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I.e &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://s3.amazonaws.com/archive.travis-ci.org/jobs/127274787/log.txt&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://s3.amazonaws.com/archive.travis-ci.org/jobs/127274787/log.txt&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/870&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/870&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It looks like `after_failure` script was not executed in such case.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Failure should at least include webapp build logs to be able to debug it further.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
